<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποντικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from Pontus, Pontic,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρεον</span>), τό, perh.
				<i>Prunus Padus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάριχος Π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.563
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π. μῦς</span> a kind of
				<i>weasel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				600b13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				632b9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π. ῥίζα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκύρριζα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π. κάρυον</span>”
				<i>hazel-nut,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.355
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				702.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέον Π.</span>
			<i>rhubarb,</i> Julianus <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποντικός</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), ὁ, name
			of month at Gortyn, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5031
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Riv.Fil.</u>
				58.475
			</span></i>).</div>
